WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Train Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Train Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.800
Step 2: Click track and snaps together. Track pieces join end to end; colour snaps click into the slots.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.800
Step 3: Press Run: the trains obey the snaps. With no code at all, trains follow snap commands like real smart trains.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.800
Step 4: Add blocks for each train. The same blocks as a real smart train, one category per train.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.200
Step 5: Try a challenge. Jobs for Train 1 tick off on the board as the train does them.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.200
Step 6: Print the challenge card. Then build the same challenge with real smart-train track.
